<title>JAPAN: Space plans share split.</title>
<headline>Space plans share split.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Space Co Ltd said on Friday</p>
<p>it planned a 1.1-for-1 share split on February 20,</p>
<p>1997 for shareholders as of December 31, 1996.</p>
</text>
